00:05:49.520 --> 00:05:52.080
to forge it into something marketable.

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:53.280
Or do you?

00:05:53.280 --> 00:05:56.880
What if you could take one simple idea, just a single sentence,

00:05:56.880 --> 00:06:00.240
and let the power of OpenAI's large language model

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:02.240
do the rest of the work for you?

00:06:02.240 --> 00:06:06.080
What used to be science fiction is now science fact.

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:11.440
This is movie pitch, and on the outside, it is so simple.

00:06:11.440 --> 00:06:14.880
We put a one-sentence idea for a movie in here,

00:06:14.880 --> 00:06:18.720
we click send, and that is all we have to do.

00:06:18.720 --> 00:06:22.800
We sit back and we wait for maybe 10 seconds or 15 seconds,

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:26.320
and then what we get back when OpenAI has done its thing

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:28.880
