01:04:00.720 --> 01:04:02.280
So far, when writing prompts,

01:04:02.280 --> 01:04:04.600
we've just provided one or more sentences

01:04:04.600 --> 01:04:06.200
asking for what we want.

01:04:06.200 --> 01:04:10.120
You'll often hear this referred to as the zero-shot approach.

01:04:10.120 --> 01:04:12.400
And what that means is it's just an instruction.

01:04:12.400 --> 01:04:15.040
Now, the zero-shot approach works really well

01:04:15.040 --> 01:04:17.160
for many simple requests.

