But when we work with more complex requests,

01:04:20.080 --> 01:04:22.840
we run a greater risk of getting back results

01:04:22.840 --> 01:04:24.760
that don't really fulfill our needs.

01:04:24.760 --> 01:04:27.080
So we might get completions which are off-topic

01:04:27.080 --> 01:04:29.320
or too long, or perhaps the format

01:04:29.320 --> 01:04:31.160
is just not what we want.

