we're actually getting a comma separated list here.

01:37:01.120 --> 01:37:03.120
And that is actually what we want.

01:37:03.120 --> 01:37:06.240
So those commas are there for a reason.

01:37:06.240 --> 01:37:10.120
Now let's come onto a new line again and I'll use a divider.

01:37:10.120 --> 01:37:13.360
And now let's just put synopsis colon.

01:37:13.360 --> 01:37:15.880
And this is where we want to pass it,

01:37:15.880 --> 01:37:19.240
the synopsis that we're bringing in right here.

01:37:19.240 --> 01:37:21.800
And then underneath that, names.

01:37:21.800 --> 01:37:23.000
And we'll leave that blank

01:37:23.000 --> 01:37:27.040
because that is where OpenAI is going to do its thing.

01:37:27.040 --> 01:37:30.120
Okay, let's hit save and we'll see if it's working.

