And now let me paste in a challenge.

01:49:44.500 --> 01:49:46.660
OK, so this is your challenge.

01:49:46.660 --> 01:49:48.660
I want you to write a prompt that

01:49:48.660 --> 01:49:50.860
will generate an image prompt that we

01:49:50.860 --> 01:49:54.700
can use to get the artwork for our movie idea.

01:49:54.700 --> 01:49:58.540
OpenAI has no knowledge of our characters, of course.

01:49:58.540 --> 01:50:01.900
So the image prompt needs descriptions, not names.

01:50:01.900 --> 01:50:03.460
What do I mean by that?

01:50:03.460 --> 01:50:06.780
Well, if we have a character in the synopsis called Katie,

01:50:06.780 --> 01:50:10.140
and maybe she's the protagonist, and our image prompt

01:50:10.140 --> 01:50:14.020
says Katie is standing in front of a burning building, well,

01:50:14.020 --> 01:50:16.580
of course, the image API has no idea

01:50:16.580 --> 01:50:19.660
who Katie is, no idea what she looks like.

01:50:19.660 --> 01:50:23.340
So what we need is a description of Katie and what she's doing.

01:50:23.340 --> 01:50:26.740
So maybe how tall she is, what she's wearing.

01:50:26.740 --> 01:50:29.820
Perhaps she's carrying an axe or some other weapon

01:50:29.820 --> 01:50:32.500
and is standing in front of a burning building.

01:50:32.500 --> 01:50:35.900
I've set this as quite an open challenge, and deliberately so.

