01:51:36.540 --> 01:51:41.500
Now, this second sentence may or may not be effective.

01:51:41.500 --> 01:51:46.380
OpenAI prefers to be told what to do, not told what not to do.

01:51:46.380 --> 01:51:48.340
But I've had reasonable success with this,

01:51:48.340 --> 01:51:50.980
so I'm going to phrase it like that.

01:51:50.980 --> 01:51:53.740
Now, I'm going to add some examples.

