we can make to really level up our chatbot skills.

02:33:36.340 --> 02:33:38.980
Now, one danger you can run into with chatbots

02:33:38.980 --> 02:33:40.740
is that they can get repetitive.

02:33:40.740 --> 02:33:43.300
