02:43:51.060 --> 02:43:53.780
And I'm going to express this as a flow chart.

02:43:53.780 --> 02:43:56.660
Firstly, ask yourself, is there a problem?

02:43:56.660 --> 02:43:59.580
If the answer is no, do nothing.

02:43:59.580 --> 02:44:03.200
If the answer is yes, then my advice is this.

02:44:03.200 --> 02:44:06.220
Don't go over one for either setting.

02:44:06.220 --> 02:44:08.860
Don't go under one for either setting.

02:44:08.860 --> 02:44:11.300
You can experiment outside of those parameters,

02:44:11.300 --> 02:44:13.780
