02:44:15.580 --> 02:44:17.380
some pretty strange results.

02:44:17.380 --> 02:44:21.680
And lastly, it's all about making small changes and testing.

02:44:21.680 --> 02:44:23.900
If you just make a small change and test,

02:44:23.900 --> 02:44:26.260
you'll very quickly find the settings

02:44:26.260 --> 02:44:29.500
