03:14:42.980 --> 03:14:46.500
I did ask it, is this a new conversation and how are you?

03:14:46.500 --> 03:14:48.980
And remember, it's giving us very short answers

03:14:48.980 --> 03:14:53.000
because we did leave the instruction right up here

03:14:53.000 --> 03:14:56.060
as you're an assistant that gives very short answers.

03:14:56.060 --> 03:14:58.620
Maybe let's just change that back to,

03:14:58.620 --> 03:15:01.220
you are a helpful assistant.

03:15:01.220 --> 03:15:03.340
What have I asked you today?

03:15:03.340 --> 03:15:05.480
And there we are, it knows everything.

03:15:05.480 --> 03:15:08.980
I'm going to click start over to clear the conversation.

03:15:08.980 --> 03:15:12.000
