03:21:34.660 --> 03:21:36.100
Okay, let's save that.

03:21:36.100 --> 03:21:38.840
And there we are, everything is looking fine.

03:21:38.840 --> 03:21:42.740
Now the rest of the CSS and HTML is going to stay the same,

