03:35:53.020 --> 03:35:55.220
So down at the bottom, it's already told us

03:35:55.220 --> 03:35:58.340
that it's necessary to convert this to JSON L.

03:35:58.340 --> 03:35:59.940
That's absolutely fine.

03:35:59.940 --> 03:36:02.580
It's recommending us to add a suffix separator

03:36:02.580 --> 03:36:03.820
