03:36:03.820 --> 03:36:05.700
Well, let's say yes to that.

03:36:05.700 --> 03:36:08.260
Now it's recommending adding a suffix ending

03:36:08.260 --> 03:36:11.180
of a new line character to all of the completions.

03:36:11.180 --> 03:36:13.700
Let's say yes to that and press enter.

03:36:13.700 --> 03:36:16.860
And now it's recommending us to add a white space character

03:36:16.860 --> 03:36:19.200
to the beginning of all of the completions.

03:36:19.200 --> 03:36:20.860
Again, let's say yes.

