to access the API.

03:37:36.340 --> 03:37:40.720
Then we need to use this fine tunes dot create command.

03:37:40.720 --> 03:37:44.940
And we use the T flag here to introduce our training data.

03:37:44.940 --> 03:37:49.480
And we save that in a file called we dash wing it dash data

03:37:49.480 --> 03:37:52.380
underscore prepared dot JSON L.

03:37:52.380 --> 03:37:54.480
Our training data, which has been prepared

