03:38:11.900 --> 03:38:14.820
Okay, let's put that command in the terminal.

03:38:14.820 --> 03:38:18.440
And when I press enter, we get this message.

03:38:18.440 --> 03:38:21.980
Now open AI needs to enqueue this and it takes some time.

03:38:21.980 --> 03:38:23.940
The quickest for me has been a few minutes.

